	(text "Five copies of the 4-channel sheet. Per group: sensor +24 V through a 0.5 A PTC and one COM jumper (1-2: COM to +24V_IO for NPN sensors, 2-3: COM to 0V_IO for PNP sensors, the default). Dry-contact switches wire between +24 V and the input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
